rce meant UTC, row 2 should be 10:05Z, which fits between the other rows. That is only an assumption, though. The file doesn't say.\n\n**Fix:**\n- Find out which timezone the system that wrote row 2 uses. If it's UTC, append `Z`.\n- Parse every row to UTC before charting.\n- Make the writer emit explicit offsets, so new rows don't come in without one.\n\nThe file only has 3 data rows. If the real data is larger, the same check will show how many rows lack an offset. I haven't changed any files.", "commits": [], "branch": "main", "before": {}, "after": {}}}